cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "EdgeBench Verified: An Audit of the Graders Behind the 51 Public EdgeBench Tasks"
message: "If you use these decisions, findings or repaired task versions, please cite this repository and the original EdgeBench."
type: dataset
version: "1.0"
date-released: "2026-10-12"
authors:
  - name: "EdgeBench Verified contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/findalexli/edgebench-verified"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  An independent audit of the graders of the 51 publicly released EdgeBench tasks. Every task has an
  outcome (kept with a note, fixed in a new version, or removed). Fixes were tested on paired
  before/after runs of the original and fixed grader on the same inputs (repeated three
  times; no fixed-grader verdict changed; exceptions are listed in METHOD.md), and formal checks in Lean 4 and
  TLA+ cover 26 tasks, proving or model-checking 10 of the 31 fixes within their models.
references:
  - type: software
    title: "EdgeBench"
    authors:
      - name: "ByteDance Seed"
    repository-code: "https://github.com/ByteDance-Seed/EdgeBench"
